    },
    {
      "text": "Hello, you've reached VeloFit. My name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765927619266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need a return label. Order number VF-7824-9101.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97019,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765927624399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment. Let me pull that up for you... I see the order for the AeroShield Helmet. Can I quickly ask the reason for the return?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765927627866665
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is wrong. My wife says it clashes with my bike. The box is unopened.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97019,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765927637133331
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand completely. We want to make sure you're happy with your gear, and getting the right color is a big part of that. Your safety is our priority, and feeling good in your helmet matters.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765927642533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. So can I return it or not?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97019,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765927655733331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. I see the helmet was delivered 27 days ago, and you are well within our 90-day return window. I have just approved the return, and the shipping label is on its way to your email right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765927658133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Got it. Thanks.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
